# Model checkpoint weights: ignored by convention. In THIS project the policy
# has only 212 parameters, so each checkpoint is ~3KB (not actually "large") —
# feel free to delete this line and track runs/**/ckpt/ if you want them in git.
# The result files that matter for the README (log.csv, config.json, ozet.*,
# karsilastirma.png, the sample .mp4) are NOT ignored and stay tracked.
runs/**/ckpt/*.pt
*.pth

